  {
   "title": "NYFF SCREENING",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>After the studio session, creators were shuttled to the New York Film Festival screening of the biopic for a once-in-a-lifetime experience. Following the screening, director Scott Cooper introduced the full cast, alongside Bruce Springsteen, who treated the audience to an intimate acoustic performance of “Land of Hope and Dreams.” The evening concluded with an after-party at Ascent Lounge, where creators mingled with the cast, filmmakers, and other VIP. guests</p>"
    },
