  {
   "title": "CREATOR & CONTENT STRATEGY",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We executed a multi-part strategy to inspire conversation and drive content creation. A handpicked mix of creators bridged music history, film, and broader cultural commentary. We selected voices with the authority, passion, and creativity to authentically connect Deliver Me From Nowhere to both devoted fans and new audiences across social platforms. Our creators included Straw Hat Goofy, Maddi Koch, Nicky Reardon, Sarah Lugor, Kacey Fifield, Mic The Snare, Saint Virgil, and Cinemonika.</p>"
    },
