  {
   "title": "TRACKSTAR SHOOT",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We executed a social-first media strategy Track Star, a cultural documentarian whose platform centers on music, film, and legacy storytelling. Track Star attended the NYFF premiere, to fully absorb the film’s emotional tone and narrative. We collaborated with him to develop a storytelling approach focused on cultural impact rather than standard press coverage.</p>",
     "right": "<p>The Track Star Show filmed an episode with Jeremy Allen White and Scott Cooper, along with a suite of social-first companion content. Track Star led a conversation about the making of Nebraska, with interviews from White, Cooper, and Warren Zanes. He shared personal memories and archival footage from past interviews, highlighting Bruce’s enduring cultural influence.</p>"
    },
    {
     "type": "video",
     "embed": "<div class=\"p-cs__video__el w-video w-embed\" style=\"padding-top:56.17021276595745%\"><iframe allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" class=\"embedly-embed\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"528\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2FMclTsKxOUWU%3Ffeature%3Doembed&amp;display_name=YouTube&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DMclTsKxOUWU&amp;image=https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2FMclTsKxOUWU%2Fhqdefault.jpg&amp;type=text%2Fhtml&amp;schema=youtube\" title=\"Jeremy Allen White, Scott Cooper (director), and Warren Zanes (Author) Talk Springsteen Biopic\" width=\"940\"></iframe></div>"
